Package: unconfoundedr
Title: Test Unconfoundedness by Comparing RCT and Observational Effects
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Diogo", family = "Ribeiro",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "diogo.debastos.ribeiro@gmail.com",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-2022-7072")))
Description: Compare marginal treatment effects from RCT-like and observational
    datasets to assess (un)confoundedness. Supports IPW/AIPW/TMLE/G-computation,
    multiple effect measures, bootstrap and analytical inference, diagnostics,
    and visualization.
